Output: min(tr_driver):INTEGER
Project "min(tr_driver)"
  Filter "min(tr_driver)" = "min(dv_id)"
    Join ONE-ROW build=right keys=[]
      Aggregate MIN(tr_driver)
        Scan table=trips source=parquet(files=1, rows=3000) columns=[tr_driver]
      Aggregate MIN(dv_id)
        Scan table=drivers source=parquet(files=1, rows=97) columns=[dv_id]
